    "The NIRF 2025 government listing was independently matched to the official Madhya Pradesh Higher Education directory record: Govt College, Palera, college code 0706, district Tikamgarh, organisation id 470.",
    "The current official college microsite is available at the orgid=470 URL and identifies शासकीय महाविद्यालय पलेरा, but its Regular Courses and Distance Education Courses tables are empty; its Prospectus and New Course Started pages contain no programme entries, and the footer reports last update 2021. Therefore the institution-site catalogue is partial and the record remains manual_review.",
    "The official ePravesh catalogue separately records college 0706 with active undergraduate B. A., B. Com., and B. Sc. families and active branches: B. A. English Literature, Economics, Sociology, Political Science, Geography, Hindi Literature; B. Com. Commerce; and B. Sc. Chemistry, Physics, Zoology, Mathematics, Botany. These were retained as official partial-catalogue evidence, but the incomplete institution microsite prevents a verified outcome.",
    "Normal TLS requests to the official government hosts failed with the managed proxy's exact self-signed certificate-chain error; the allowed --insecure fallback was used only for public requests after confirming the expected official hostnames. The legacy website URL reported by the ePravesh record timed out over HTTPS and was not used as evidence."
